{"id":"vod_sn_38647","vodId":"38647","provider":"sn","providerName":"索尼资源","type":2,"name":"满月之战","name_cn":"满月之战","date":"2019-01-01","year":"2019","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"已完结","images":{"common":"https://snzypic.vip/upload/vod/20230911-1/c033f9659c101e10e834c7e4b1cc3ae2.jpg"},"summary":"曾经，这是一个人类和魔法共存的世界，但一场意外的发生令魔法就此消身匿迹，一晃眼就是1000年过去，人类甚至连他们曾经拥有魔法这件事情都给忘记了。小日向满月（岛袋美由利 配音）是一名个性活泼开朗的女子高中生，不擅长拒绝的她无论别人拜托什么事情都会满口答应下来，因此在当地人缘非常的好。　　一天，小日向满月邂逅了一位名叫新月艾尔涅丝塔深海（种崎敦美 配音）的神秘少女，看上去冷漠孤傲拒人于千里之外的少女，也被小日向满月的热情给融化了。在新月艾尔涅丝塔深海的带领之下，小日向满月第一次知道这个世界上存在着人偶阿尔玛诺克斯，同时亦得知了魔法并没有完全绝迹的真相。","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2023-09-11 16:03:21","playable":true,"episodeCount":13,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"snm3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第01集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/gyJZC3UuEp1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/chMB1C7peb1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/g3vstvB1JC1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/A8kERWprCU1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/s9jGMHYXRY1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/BNYiT0CLYs1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/Lbw0caKxUe1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/Z1zNvuA8SS1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/tA1LPpTiTR1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/T7q3rVp5kK1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/P30xUqPbeM1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/ZceC40YZfe1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第13集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/uD4JSzCxit1/video/index.m3u8"}]}],"snapshotAt":"2026-10-22T15:44:56.330Z"}